# CODEOWNERS -- automatically requests review from the listed owner(s)
# whenever a PR touches a matching path. In a real team repo this maps to
# groups (e.g. @org/data-platform-team); as a solo portfolio repo it's set
# to the repo owner, but it's here to show the pattern and so it's a
# one-line change to hand ownership of a path to a teammate later.

# Default owner for everything not matched below
*                           @Gourishshiragur

# Pipeline core logic and merge/upsert business rules deserve the most
# scrutiny -- correctness bugs here are silent-data-corruption risk, not
# just a failed test.
/src/pipeline/              @Gourishshiragur

# CI/CD changes should get a second look before merging, since a bad
# workflow change can silently stop tests from running rather than
# failing loudly.
/.github/workflows/         @Gourishshiragur

# ADF reference definitions -- see adf/README.md before treating anything
# here as a live deployment path.
/adf/                       @Gourishshiragur
